      "section": "dsh-voice-plugin",
      "text": "[English](README.md) | [中文](README.zh.md)\n\n> If you are an agent, read AGENTS.md first.\n\nAdd a microphone to the DeepSeek Harness composer so you can input by voice."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-voice-plugin"
    },
    {
      "section": "or straight from GitHub:",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add github:yafangwang9/dsh-voice-plugin\n```\n\nThen restart `dsh web`."
    },
    {
      "section": "Configure",
      "text": "Open **Settings → Plugins → voice-plugin** and pick your model:\n\n- Chinese → **Doubao Voice**\n- English or other languages → **OpenAI**\n\nFill in only that model's API Key. If it isn't configured yet, clicking the mic just points you to Settings."
